# Accepted container findings (security review, 2026-10-29).
#
# Each is a High in a Debian base package with no fixed version published.
# Paiso never runs these programs or loads these libraries for its own work;
# they are part of the python:3.12-slim base. The Dockerfile upgrades every
# package at build time, so a fix is picked up by the next image. Remove a
# line once Debian ships its fix.
#
# util-linux (mount, login, libblkid, libmount, libuuid, ...)
CVE-2026-76642
CVE-2026-78408
CVE-2026-78409
CVE-2026-78410
# ncurses
CVE-2025-69720
# systemd (libsystemd0, libudev1)
CVE-2026-16742
